    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "STRANGEASIT SEEMS\nJOHN\nHIX\nlainliner\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\n•HOUGH birds have been masters of flying\n• since time immemorial and man only suc-\nceeded in accomplishing mechanical flight\nsince the turn of the\ncentury, the modern,\nman-made plane can fly farther, faster and\nhigher than any bird has ever flown.",
      "DO YOU KNOW\nTHAT UNITED.\nHas flown over 125,000,000 miles more miles than any other\nair line in the world?\n*\nHas flown more passenger-miles, more express, more mail than\nany other air line in the world?\n*\nIs the oldest air transport company in the United States, and\noperates the oldest coast-to-coast airway?\nOperates the world's largest fleet of modern twin- engined\nplanes —directly serving 35 cities in fifteen states?\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nTO ALASKA\nTO THE\nORIENT\nTACOMA •-\nRainier\nVANCOUVER\nCANADA\nSPOKANE\nUNITED AIR LINES\nwret _ Coast-to-Coast Overnight via Uniteds Main Line Mid Continent Airway\nPORTLAND\nCrater Lake\nTO HAWAI\nSALT LAKE\nSAN\nFRANCISCO\n•Gen. Grant\nCedar\n• Sequoia\nBreaks\n•Zion\nBoulder Dam\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES!\nTHE HAVENT\nSAN DIEGO\nGrand Canyon\nGREAT FALLS\nBlack\nHills\nDuce\n• Kanches\nERSOLIN\nRocky.\nMUENVEN\nMountain\nKANSAS CITY\nST. LOUIS\n~ TO EUROPI\nNEW YORK\nHILADELPHIA\nSAMUEN\nHINGTON\nA To Mesice Cry\nTo Mesico City, Central and South\nUNITED AIR LINES\n•ST. PETERSBU\nConnecting Air Lines\nRoil Lines .....Highways\n• National Parks\nTo Cobe, Contral and"
